	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE D5:\n• J5 WAGO 2606-1102: push-in CAGE CLAMP, one lever per pole, 7.5 mm pitch [DS]\n• IEC 60664-1: 630 V (OVC III, PD2), 500 V (III, PD3), 1000 V (II, PD2); 6 kV impulse; 41 A [DS]\n• UL 1059: 300 V groups B and D (base part); 2606-1102/020-000 is the 600 V UL variant; CSA 600 V [DS]\n• Here: each electrode up to +/-110 V to ISO_GND (D10 VBR 111 V min), 5 mA operating, 10 mA limit [H]\n• Wire: solid or fine-stranded 0.2-10 mm2 (24-8 AWG), no ferrule; strip 11-13 mm [DS]"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 85.32 226.06 0)
		(size 62 27.94)
